---
const info = [
  { label: 'Role', value: 'Cloud Technical Engineer' },
  { label: 'Based', value: 'UK · working remotely' },
  { label: 'Focus', value: 'SharePoint · Power Platform · AI' },
];
---

<section class="about" id="about">
  <div class="inner about-grid">
    <div class="about-head" data-reveal>
      <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
      <h2 class="section-title">
        Equal parts systems thinking and things people actually enjoy using.
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="about-body">
      <p data-reveal>
        I get handed a lot of different problems across a lot of different
        tenants, and I genuinely like it that way. Most of my week lives in
        SharePoint, the Power Platform, and increasingly the AI side of
        Microsoft's stack.
      </p>
      <p data-reveal data-delay="80">
        I care about solutions that are maintainable, properly deployed, and
        pleasant to actually live with - the engineering fundamentals sitting
        under all the low-code matter to me as much as the outcome.
      </p>

      <div class="info-grid" data-reveal data-delay="160">
        {info.map(({ label, value }) => (
          <div class="info-cell">
            <span class="info-label">{label}</span>
            <span class="info-value">{value}</span>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    padding: 120px 40px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    background: var(--bg);
  }

  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.85fr 1.15fr;
    gap: 64px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .about-head .eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .about-body p {
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 22px;
  }

  .about-body p:last-of-type {
    margin-bottom: 34px;
  }

  .info-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1px;
    background: var(--border-soft);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
    border-radius: 14px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .info-cell {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    background: var(--bg-card);
    padding: 20px 22px;
  }

  .info-label {
    font: 500 11px/1 var(--font-mono);
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-faint);
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .info-value {
    font: 500 15px/1.4 var(--font-body);
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 40px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .about {
      padding: 78px 22px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .info-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
